00:56:37,004 --> 00:56:37,404
[SPEAKER_02]: I'm sorry.

693
00:56:37,424 --> 00:56:39,846
[SPEAKER_02]: What do you mean by resistance?

694
00:56:40,847 --> 00:56:44,069
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, it's what I was talking about, the four great elements, for example.

695
00:56:46,030 --> 00:56:47,290
[SPEAKER_01]: They are what your body is made of.

696
00:56:47,311 --> 00:56:48,671
[SPEAKER_02]: I just have a question.

